      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Mungú doori nee yaamu nee muruuwós sleémeero gay adoorír hhe'eés tleehhamooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ay bál baalár faanqw Mungú gadiyeérós sleémeero gaa hhe'eés, tidá' sleémeero ar aa tleéhh. Mungú iri hungu/uús bál baalár faanqwe, gadiyeeduwós kudá' sleémeero ngiwa hhe'eés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú baalaadár faanqw gana tsuúq, gari hhoohhoeés. Asma ina hungu/uús gadiyeeduwós kudá' sleémeero ngiwa hhe'eés awa tleehhamór doori nee yaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí an alki/ituú adoodá' doori nee yaamu kira tleéhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadá' AAKOÓ Mungú yaamu nee doori ngiwa tleéhh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gár naa ti'it i káhh baraá xatsoowo. Tam gitso naa ti'iitiká, asma AAKOÓ Mungú tluwaay gwa haniisiiká, laqaá tam heé yaamu gaa doosl i kaahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutli niri baraá yaamuú wa ti'ít, nee yaamu sleémeero giri naa/ás.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ Mungú hee guri tleéhh ar hhape, guri hiinsluú slafíngw i ufaáhh, hee tari heé slaáf.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ Mungú asalmo guri dahaás bihhaá da/aáw baraá yaamaá Edeni. Heewós kudá' aa tleéhh guri baraadádí qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ Mungú xaa'aá daa'aweemaá dimbadimbé giri baraá hhapér wa titi'iís, xaa'aá hhohho' nee awa /aymár ya/aamá'. Nee baraá tla/ángw asalmoowo Mungú xa'anoó mamuuwós slafíngw hanmiisá' guri qaás. Nee xa'anoó mamuuwós xu'utír muruú hhó' nee oo tlákw laqaaqamá' guri malé qaás.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaae i deer ar baraá asalmoó Edenír wa wa/amiim, i asalmoó naa/amaamís. Aluuwo tiri qasmís tari yau tsiyáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú yaaér geera a Pishoni, an tidá' yaamaá Hawila gaa harwet. Baraadae sahaábu i deer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee sahaábuú yaamuudá' ku ló'wa hhohhó'. Slám baraadae tlaa/aá hhohho' awa ta bay bedoóla i dayá', nee tlaa/aá tlaxo gawden awa ta bay shohamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee umuú yaaér tsár a Gihoni, an yaaér yaamaá Kushi sleémeero gaa harwet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee umuú yaaér tám a Tigri. An yaaeedá' aa waarahh ar bihhaá da/aáw awa yaamaá Ashuru. Nee umuú yaaér tsiyáhh a Eufrate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ Mungú heedaádá' guri huúw nee guri qaás baraá asalmoodá' ta bay Edeni, as nguwa doosli nee nguwa amohhe'eemisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ Mungú heedaádá' guri hara'ayín guri báy, «Mamaá xaai sleémeero awa baraá asalmoowí i asleér /aymaaro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala mamaá xa'anoó xu'utír muruú hhó' nee oo tlákw, mi /ayaar, asma bál mamaá xa'anoowí bira /ák xueek, a gwá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ Mungú iri oó', «Hee iwa kilós hooti a gár hhooeeká. Heé nee inós slaqmís un tleéhh, oo alee/iisaywós wa hariím.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ Mungú umuúqo makiito'ór sla/to gana titi'iís baraá yaamuú wa alé, nee tsir/ór gáwtí tlatlaaw, giri dír heedaádií huúw as ngiwa umeérí tlaaqi. Muruú slaáf sleémeero guri umeérí tlaáq, umeedá' tari umer'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee giri umeérí tlaáq umuúqo makiito'ór ta de'ena nee tsir/ór gáwtí tlatlaawa, nee umuúqo makaá baraá darmú hoota'a. Ala alee/isusmoó inós wa hariím gwaa slayká baraá tla/angw'ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ Mungú hee guri gu'tér iló' i haniís. Hee iwa baraá gu'teérií dirii'i, AAKOÓ Mungú guri gweehhamoó wák tuú/, didaádá' gari fu'unár tuuntuúk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee gwehhamodá' aa tuú/ baraá heé wa alé, AAKOÓ Mungú guri /ameenírár tleéhh, gari huúw dír heedaádá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedá' iri oó',",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
